WEBVTT

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:11.320
Okay...

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:55.570
<b>Episode 4: 
Sea of Stars</b>

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:55.570
Thunderclouds, of all things.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:59.900
Those rescue signals don't have much output. 
Finding them will be hard now.

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:05.630
Ariel, I'm sure they're both fine!

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:06.840
Yeah.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:10.810
But with this rain, it'll be hard to find them.

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:13.510
Benji, keep your mouth shut...

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:15.400
I'm sorry.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.490
Wait!

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:27.390
What are you doing?

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:28.710
Stop it!

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:31.620
If you get lost, too, it'll only 
be harder to find them!

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:32.960
Let me go...

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:33.930
Hey!

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.020
Calm down!

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:42.220
The knights are already looking for them.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:48.150
He isn't so bad, after all...

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:49.730
I'm surprised, though.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.650
Leave this to us. Everyone, go home.

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:56.900
B-But...

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:57.980
We still...

00:02:57.980 --> 00:02:59.150
That's an order!

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.560
Understood.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:04.870
If the knights are already searching,

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.250
there's nothing for us to do.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:09.160
Let's obey our instructors' orders.

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:13.020
You, too.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:14.090
Got it?

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:20.220
I'm staying here.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.090
Ari...

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.380
I'm waiting here.

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:29.710
Are you cold?

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:30.940
I'm all right.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:34.870
Today just isn't our day...

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.070
I guess not.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:41.070
In this rain, they won't be able to rescue us.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.070
I hope it stops before nightfall.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.700
It's okay.

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:52.350
Yeah, you're here with me.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:53.710
So I'm fine.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:03:59.750
Reporting!

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:05.120
We've searched areas 35 and 36.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:09.250
We'll have to hold off on the 
rest because of the rain.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.470
Understood.

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.800
Excuse me.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:16.610
If they made an emergency landing,

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:19.350
they'll be out there the entire night.

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:22.860
I hope they last...

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:26.490
Ariel, are you really going to stay here?

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:33.160
Fine, we'll stay with you.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.670
The guys will, too, right?

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.960
Yeah, I'll stay, as well.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.990
No one's going home.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:40.520
Not if everyone's staying here.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:43.470
I'm sure they'll come back safely.

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:46.550
That's right.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:47.540
Right!

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:48.260
Yeah.

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:52.270
Yeah, I'm sure they'll come back.

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:56.570
Ever since that night, we've been together.

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:01.760
I remember that night really well.

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:04.840
After the Wind Revolution was over,

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:07.490
a boy I didn't know at all came to our house.

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:10.040
Who are you?

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.800
Your new brother.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.890
He's been through some stuff.

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:17.970
So from now on, he'll be staying here.

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:22.420
His name is Kal-el Albus. 
He's your stepbrother.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:24.660
Wow!

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:27.560
Yay, that's great! A little brother!

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.220
Yeah, a little brother!

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:31.490
Thanks, Dad!

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:32.970
I love you!

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.770
I'm thirsty...

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.710
I'm Noelle... I'm sixteen.

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:43.900
Nice to meet you.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.890
You can call me "Sis."

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:48.080
I'm Manuelle... I'm twelve!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.810
I'm so happy to have a cute little brother!

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.010
He looked away...

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:54.250
He's adorable!

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:56.540
Yeah, he's super cute...

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.030
He's blushing!

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:01.380
Come on, Ari...

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.360
You introduce yourself, too!

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:05.270
Come on...

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:08.500
I'm Ariel.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:09.920
I'm nine.

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:11.600
What's wrong, Ari?

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.640
What's bothering you?

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.630
How old is he?

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:19.490
That's right! We haven't heard yet.

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:21.540
How old are you, Kal-el?

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:25.530
Nine...

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.430
The same age as Ari!

00:06:27.430 --> 00:06:29.190
The same age?

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.450
Kal, when were you born?

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.120
June 6th.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.210
Kal's older than you!

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:40.980
You were born on June 7th.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:52.550
Then that's why you always 
argue about who's younger.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:53.410
Yeah.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:56.190
But why did Kal come to your place?

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:57.850
Is he a relative or something?

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:01.720
Kal's parents died...

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:05.020
And my dad couldn't just leave him alone.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.860
He brought him to live with us.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.760
Oh...

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:11.910
I guess he's had it tough.

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.060
But...

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:16.640
At first, he wouldn't say anything.

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:22.120
Kal-el, this is called ramen.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.050
It's delicious... Try it!

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.310
What's wrong? Aren't you hungry?

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:31.140
Pathetic...

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:34.150
I don't know what happened, 
but you can't even respond?

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:35.680
You suck!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:38.680
I think I'm your big sister, after all.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:41.900
I'm far more adult than you.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:43.520
Even when I'm feeling down,

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.080
I still eat...

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.710
And when someone asks 
me something, I answer.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.330
Now, Ari...

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:56.490
He's in a new house, so he's nervous.

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:59.580
Yeah, he's just nervous.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.580
What?! And you call yourself my big brother?

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:05.630
Even a kid can respond better than that!

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:09.430
I'll try it.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:30.490
At first, I had a lot of trouble accepting him.

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:39.830
Come on, it's bedtime.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:44.460
Our sisters are getting preparing 
tomorrow's breakfast...

00:08:58.650 --> 00:08:59.730
Goodnight.

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.090
Mother...

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:19.310
When I was born, my mom died...

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:26.200
So I understood what it meant 
not to have a mom.

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:29.710
Kal isn't really my brother,

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:32.910
but I've always treated him like he is.

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:35.310
It's okay...

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:37.740
Kal and Claire will both come back.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.330
Yeah, that's right.

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:44.990
But I wonder if he's freaked out, 
being alone with her.

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:47.280
Right.

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:52.440
<i>But I can't tell everyone</i>

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:54.920
<i>who Kal really is.</i>

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:06.170
Come on, hurry!

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:09.250
We have to take Dad his lunch!

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:16.260
Hey, Ariel... Are you going to see it, too?

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:17.280
See what?

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.220
The plaza.

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:21.580
They're putting on a play 
of the Wind Revolution!

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:36.220
Nina, please forgive us...

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:37.990
Please forgive us!

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:41.490
It's too late for you to beg for your lives.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:43.210
Emperor Gregorio,

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:44.690
Empress Maria...

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:47.080
While you lived in luxury,

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.410
the people were suffering!

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:50.500
Yeah!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:52.350
She's right!

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:53.090
You did it!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:55.290
You're the ones who ruined the country!

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:57.260
Die, witch...

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:00.070
Nice job!

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:04.720
What are you doing?

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:07.020
What's his problem?

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:12.010
What are you doing?

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:14.370
Hey, Damien...

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:15.320
Stop it—

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:18.900
Are you okay?

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:21.310
Apologize...

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:22.070
Stop!

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:25.780
Apologize to my mother!

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:28.470
Mother?

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:34.970
<i>Kal-el is the prince, Karl La Hire...</i>

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:41.010
It's beautiful.

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:49.560
Kal-el?

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:51.790
The lifeboat...

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:54.970
It's filled with water.

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:56.610
We have to empty it out.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:59.230
Do you have it?

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:00.530
I'll help.

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:01.820
I can do it alone.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.420
There we go.

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:06.470
Kal-el—

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:13.420
They'll dry before long, won't they?

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.850
Yeah, I think so.

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:26.890
I know!

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:31.930
Claire, we can use this to fish.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:33.190
Fish?

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:47.800
I'm sorry.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.510
I'm really sorry...

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:54.410
Y-You don't need to apologize so much.

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:01.290
I've never been fishing...

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:03.120
I've gone a few times.

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:05.460
With Ari, Noelle, and Manuelle.

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:08.270
M-My sis— My older sisters.

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:10.600
Besides Ariel, I have two older sisters.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:12.150
I see...

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:16.070
Whenever I see the setting sun, I remember...

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:19.480
The first time I flew.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:23.270
My dad was an airplane mechanic.

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:27.160
That day, we'd gone to take him lunch.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:31.540
But on the way, I got into a fight 
with some punks in town.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:33.450
Here you go, Dad!

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:34.950
Lunch!

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:37.150
It's already dinnertime, silly...

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:46.680
Boss, we need to give it a test flight!

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:47.400
Right.

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:49.510
You wanna fly, too?

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:53.000
Huh? That isn't fair!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.510
You always get to fly...

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.100
Get in the back.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.450
Here we go!

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:15.750
Present altitude, 300 meters...

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:19.580
500 meters.

00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:21.720
800 meters.

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:24.840
1,200 meters.

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:29.390
1,800 meters.

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.770
How ya doing? Scared?

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:33.540
No...

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:36.010
You like being up high?

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:36.830
Yeah.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:37.850
Okay.

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:39.830
2,000 meters!

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:44.840
That's Alexandra.

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:51.530
It's so small...

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:55.680
There's so much to see.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.310
Look, the sea!

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:07.340
What do you suppose lies beyond it?

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:11.630
I'd like to see it myself, honestly...

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:12.850
The End of the Sky.

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:15.850
The End of the Sky?

00:15:16.230 --> 00:15:18.600
Go find it for me!

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.460
You will fly!

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:40.050
That was when I decided I'd become a pilot!

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:41.500
I see...

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:44.130
S-Sorry to ramble on.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.050
No...

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:50.220
We aren't catching anything.

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:54.840
If you eat a fish right after 
catching it, it's delicious.

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:58.350
Ari would clean it and make all kinds of food.

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:00.100
Ari's amazing...

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:02.610
Only her cooking's amazing.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:05.480
She's foul-mouthed, violent,

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:08.200
bowlegged, and she snores.

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:09.800
That isn't true.

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:12.710
She's wonderful.

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:13.860
She is?

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:19.490
Yeah, I think she really cares about you...

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:22.250
Eh?! That's how it looks to you?

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:26.270
She's always getting mad and yelling at me.

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:29.930
That's because she cares about you.

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:30.880
Really?

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:37.010
Right now, I'm sure she's 
really worried about you.

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:38.630
I don't know...

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:42.390
When you get back, you should 
apologize and say, "Thank you."

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:45.680
Yeah.

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:07.310
Thanks for going and trying to save him...

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:10.730
I didn't think you cared so much 
about your classmates.

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:12.880
You think too well of me.

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:18.550
They'll both be back tomorrow, right?

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:27.770
I'm sorry... We didn't catch anything.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:29.750
You're hungry, aren't you?

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:31.540
No, I'm fine.

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:36.320
Why don't you get some sleep, Claire?

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:39.480
I don't think I could sleep now.

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:42.100
Then why don't we talk some more.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:46.320
Now it's your turn to tell me about yourself.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:49.190
Why did you decide to be a pilot?

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:50.950
I...

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:54.460
Did your family oppose it?

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:58.620
I lived away from my mother, so...

00:17:58.620 --> 00:17:59.910
I see...

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:04.000
I lived away from my little brother, as well...

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.850
Admiral Luis let me come aboard Isla.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:08.590
Admiral Luis?

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.290
Ah...

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:14.230
I guess we're a bit alike.

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:18.890
After the Wind Revolution, 
I lost my real parents, too.

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:22.770
And when I was alone, the dad 
I have now took me in.

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:24.870
Really.

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:28.380
So I'm not related to Ari...

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:31.870
Before then, I lived in Alexandra.

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:34.420
And I never had to do anything for myself.

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:37.940
But the people in the Albus 
family taught me a lot...

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:40.550
You're tired, right?

00:18:40.780 --> 00:18:42.800
Why not rest a little?

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.820
Yeah, I will.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:51.450
<i>He lost his parents in the Wind Revolution...</i>

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:53.240
<i>He lived in Alexandra...</i>

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:56.840
<i>And until then, he never had 
to do anything for himself.</i>

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:02.870
<i>Could he be...</i>

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:07.040
The former crown prince of Balsteros, Karl La Hire,

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:10.510
might have sneaked on board Isla.

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:14.290
And he wants revenge against Nina Viento.

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:18.300
<i>No... That's impossible.</i>

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:37.150
Claire, that's a knight formation...

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.010
We're safe now.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:43.990
Hey! Hey!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.780
Hey!

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:08.710
I'm so relieved...

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:12.220
See? I told you they'd be fine!

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:21.230
Ari!

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:23.160
I'm sorry I worried you...

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:25.200
What was that for—

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.840
Everyone was worried about you!

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:31.190
And you're a wimp, a screw-up, and you 
put Claire in a lot of danger!

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:32.250
Ariel...

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:34.880
Everyone stayed here the whole night...

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:35.630
Apologize!

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.910
Apologize to everyone!

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:39.220
That's enough.

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:41.880
Everyone was so worried...

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:50.780
I'm sorry, Ari.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:53.980
I'm sorry.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:16.120
This is why I was opposed to 
your attending flying school.

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:19.000
I'm sorry...

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.840
Hurry and have her change!

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:33.390
I am

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:39.360
the one who destroys the wicked 
and upholds the righteous...

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:43.940
I am the one who calls the wind, 
and who commands the wind.

00:21:56.470 --> 00:21:59.900
I am Nina Viento.

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:32.590
I am Ignacio.

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:35.260
First, he was in his underwear, 
and now, a swimsuit?

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:37.020
What a fool...

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:39.850
Enjoy it while it lasts, underwear bo—

00:23:39.950 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>Episode 5: 
The Girl Who Calls the Wind</b>

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:42.980
<b></b>
